{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e723ab39-5b9b-8bd4-8f3e-2be90bb6af46",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:41:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kathleen Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:38:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. My name is Kathleen Brennan. I am calling for my mother. She lives at 411 Kay Street. Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 411 Kay Street. Got it. What's going on there, Kathleen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:38:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The water. After the storm. The big storm that ended Saturday. Two days now. It is still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still sitting there, okay. Where's the water, exactly? In the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:39:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "At the end of the driveway. The apron, you say? The part by the street. It holds a puddle. Big one. And it goes toward the garage door. It runs down, to the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the puddle pools at the bottom of the driveway and drains back toward the garage. Is it getting inside the garage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:39:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not inside yet. Very close. [pause] Sorry. Wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, Mateo, you are a dragon. Yes. Dragon. Sorry. My son. He has a costume. He says only dragon. He does not answer to his name today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Dragon it is. Is the water in the street too, or just the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Also the street. The cars come slow, slow. Like, a crawl. All the cars go through the water. It is very slow. This is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:40:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so traffic's crawling through it on Kay Street. Has anybody from the city been out since the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:40:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Nobody came. My mother said nobody. Two days. We wait and wait. It is always the same after rain. [line breaks up] ...every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:40:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up a little. You said it happens every time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:40:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Every time it rains a lot. The water stays. Nobody fixes. I want somebody to come and look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:40:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm writing this up: 411 Kay Street, water ponding at the driveway apron, running toward the garage door, slowing traffic, no city visit since Saturday. I'll send it to the crew supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, can somebody call me back? When it is done. When somebody goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:40:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168. Kathleen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:41:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168, Kathleen. I'll have someone call you once the crew's checked it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Goodbye. Say bye, dragon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye, dragon. Take care."
    }
  ],
